  "description": "A utility library for simplifying HttpClient usage in .NET applications, including\n\t\t\tfeatures for telemetry, caching, Polly integration, concurrent requests, and web\n\t\t\tcrawling. Supports .NET 8 (LTS) and .NET 9.",
